        "desc": "After the fall of Numenor only some of the shores that were once colonized\nremained property of the 'pure blooded' as the fierce Black Numenoreans called\nthemselves. You are standing in one of those places and the landscape reminds\nyou of Eru's wrath and the days of the Fall. Where once stood the glorious\npurple temples for the Black Lord's worship, dark ruins fester like wounds upon\nthe land. But, who knows, some power might still hide through the shadows of the\npast...\n",
